      "description": "<p>Unconscious from the chasme's drone. Repeats the Con save at the end of each of its turns. Ends if it takes damage, after 10 minutes, or if Holy Water is emptied on it (delete this effect). Demons automatically succeed. A creature that succeeds is immune to this chasme's Drone for 24 hours.</p>",
